<h1>Lab Guide<br>DevOps Pipeline with Terraform, Docker, K3d &amp; GitHub Actions</h1>

<p class="subtitle">
Disusun oleh: Nita Oktaviani | Juli 2026<br>
Repository: https://github.com/nitaoktaviani28/project-web-devops
</p>

<h2>1. Overview</h2>

<p>Lab ini memandu langkah-langkah membangun pipeline DevOps end-to-end. Peserta akan mempelajari provisioning infrastructure di AWS, containerization, Kubernetes deployment, dan CI/CD automation.</p>

<table>
<tr><th>Tool</th><th>Fungsi</th></tr>
<tr><td>Terraform</td><td>Provisioning infrastructure (VPC, Security Group, EC2) di AWS</td></tr>
<tr><td>Docker</td><td>Build container image aplikasi</td></tr>
<tr><td>K3d</td><td>Lightweight Kubernetes cluster (K3s in Docker)</td></tr>
<tr><td>GitHub Actions</td><td>CI/CD pipeline (auto build, push, deploy)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Docker Hub</td><td>Container image registry</td></tr>
<tr><td>DevFormat</td><td>Web tool untuk generate Terraform, Dockerfile, K8s manifest</td></tr>
</table>

