<p style="text-align:center; margin-top:12pt; font-size:10pt;"><strong>Flow Pipeline:</strong></p>
<p style="text-align:center; font-size:9pt; color:#2c3e50;">
[git push to main] &rarr; [GitHub Actions triggered] &rarr; [Docker Build] &rarr; [Push to Docker Hub with SHA tag] &rarr; [SSH to EC2] &rarr; [kubectl apply] &rarr; [App Live on :30080]
</p>
