<h2>3. Prasyarat</h2>

<h3>3.1 Spesifikasi Minimum</h3>

<table>
<tr><th>Komponen</th><th>Spesifikasi</th></tr>
<tr><td>PC/Laptop</td><td>Windows 10/11, RAM 4GB+, Internet stabil</td></tr>
<tr><td>AWS Account</td><td>Free tier atau berbayar, IAM user dengan access key</td></tr>
<tr><td>EC2 Instance</td><td>t3.medium (2 vCPU, 4GB RAM), Ubuntu 24.04, 20GB gp3 storage</td></tr>
<tr><td>GitHub Account</td><td>Untuk repository dan GitHub Actions</td></tr>
<tr><td>Docker Hub Account</td><td>Untuk simpan container image</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>3.2 Akun yang Harus Disiapkan</h3>

<table>
<tr><th>Akun</th><th>URL</th><th>Yang Dibutuhkan</th></tr>
<tr><td>AWS</td><td>https://aws.amazon.com</td><td>Access Key ID + Secret Access Key (dari IAM)</td></tr>
<tr><td>GitHub</td><td>https://github.com</td><td>Repository + akses Settings untuk Secrets</td></tr>
<tr><td>Docker Hub</td><td>https://hub.docker.com</td><td>Username + Access Token (dari Security settings)</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>4. Langkah-langkah Lab</h2>

<h3>STEP 1: Fork Repository</h3>

<div class="note"><strong>Info:</strong> Peserta cukup fork repository, tidak perlu membuat project dari awal.</div>

<ol>
<li>Buka https://github.com/nitaoktaviani28/project-web-devops</li>
<li>Klik tombol <strong>Fork</strong> di kanan atas</li>
<li>Clone repository ke komputer lokal:</li>
</ol>

<pre>git clone https://github.com/USERNAME_ANDA/project-web-devops.git
cd project-web-devops</pre>

<h3>STEP 2: Install Tools di PC</h3>

<p>Buka <strong>CMD sebagai Administrator</strong>, lalu jalankan:</p>

<pre>choco install terraform awscli git -y</pre>

<p>Tutup CMD, buka CMD baru, lalu verifikasi:</p>

<pre>terraform --version
aws --version
git --version</pre>

<div class="note"><strong>Catatan:</strong> Jika belum punya Chocolatey, install dari https://chocolatey.org/install</div>

<h3>STEP 3: Konfigurasi AWS CLI</h3>

<p>Jalankan di CMD:</p>

<pre>aws configure</pre>

<p>Isi sesuai tabel berikut:</p>

<table>
<tr><th>Prompt</th><th>Isi dengan</th></tr>
<tr><td>AWS Access Key ID</td><td>Access Key dari IAM Console AWS</td></tr>
<tr><td>AWS Secret Access Key</td><td>Secret Key dari IAM Console AWS</td></tr>
<tr><td>Default region name</td><td>ap-southeast-1</td></tr>
<tr><td>Default output format</td><td>json</td></tr>
</table>

<p>Verifikasi credential berhasil:</p>

<pre>aws sts get-caller-identity</pre>

<p>Jika muncul Account ID dan ARN, berarti sudah benar.</p>

<div class="warning"><strong>Troubleshooting:</strong> Jika secret key tidak terinput via <code>aws configure</code>, edit manual file <code>%USERPROFILE%\.aws\credentials</code> menggunakan Notepad.</div>

<h3>STEP 4: Generate SSH Key</h3>

<pre>ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f %USERPROFILE%\.ssh\vm-demo-key -N "" -C "vm-demo"</pre>

<p>Lihat public key (akan dipakai di Terraform):</p>

<pre>type %USERPROFILE%\.ssh\vm-demo-key.pub</pre>

<p>Output contoh: <code>ssh-ed25519 AAAA...xxxxx vm-demo</code></p>

<h3>STEP 5: Konfigurasi Terraform</h3>

<p>Buat file <code>terraform/terraform.tfvars</code> (file ini sudah di-gitignore):</p>

<pre>name               = "vm-demo"
vpc_cidr           = "10.0.0.0/16"
public_subnet_cidr = "10.0.1.0/24"
availability_zone  = "ap-southeast-1a"
instance_type      = "t3.medium"

tags = {}

ssh_public_key = "ssh-ed25519 AAAA...paste-public-key-dari-step-4..."</pre>

<div class="warning"><strong>PENTING:</strong> Ganti value <code>ssh_public_key</code> dengan output dari Step 4. Pastikan dalam satu baris.</div>

<h3>STEP 6: Provision Infrastructure dengan Terraform</h3>

<pre>cd terraform
terraform init
terraform plan
terraform apply -auto-approve</pre>

<p>Tunggu hingga selesai. Catat output berikut:</p>

<pre>instance_public_ip = "x.x.x.x"   &lt;-- IP ini akan dipakai untuk SSH dan GitHub Secret</pre>

<div class="success"><strong>Hasil:</strong> VPC, Subnet, Internet Gateway, Route Table, Security Group (port 22, 80, 30080), dan EC2 Instance berhasil dibuat di AWS Singapore.</div>

<h3>STEP 7: SSH ke EC2 dan Install Docker + K3d</h3>

<p>SSH ke VM dari CMD (ganti IP dengan output Step 6):</p>

<pre>ssh -i %USERPROFILE%\.ssh\vm-demo-key ubuntu@x.x.x.x</pre>

<p>Setelah berhasil masuk VM, <strong>paste seluruh script berikut</strong> (satu kali paste):</p>

<pre>curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sh &amp;&amp; \
sudo usermod -aG docker $USER &amp;&amp; \
curl -s https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k3d-io/k3d/main/install.sh | bash &amp;&amp; \
curl -LO "https://dl.k8s.io/release/$(curl -L -s https://dl.k8s.io/release/stable.txt)/bin/linux/amd64/kubectl" &amp;&amp; \
sudo install -o root -g root -m 0755 kubectl /usr/local/bin/kubectl &amp;&amp; \
rm kubectl &amp;&amp; \
sudo systemctl enable docker &amp;&amp; \
sudo systemctl start docker &amp;&amp; \
sudo k3d cluster create mycluster --port "30080:30080@server:0" --agents 2 &amp;&amp; \
mkdir -p ~/.kube &amp;&amp; \
sudo k3d kubeconfig get mycluster &gt; ~/.kube/config &amp;&amp; \
chmod 600 ~/.kube/config &amp;&amp; \
echo 'export KUBECONFIG=/home/ubuntu/.kube/config' &gt;&gt; ~/.bashrc &amp;&amp; \
export KUBECONFIG=/home/ubuntu/.kube/config &amp;&amp; \
kubectl get nodes</pre>

<p>Tunggu 2-3 menit. Expected output:</p>

<pre>NAME                      STATUS   ROLES                  AGE   VERSION
k3d-mycluster-server-0    Ready    control-plane,master   1m    v1.35.x
k3d-mycluster-agent-0     Ready    &lt;none&gt;                 1m    v1.35.x
k3d-mycluster-agent-1     Ready    &lt;none&gt;                 1m    v1.35.x</pre>

<div class="success"><strong>Hasil:</strong> Docker, K3d, dan kubectl terinstall. K3d cluster berjalan dengan 1 server + 2 agent nodes.</div>

<h3>STEP 8: Setup GitHub Secrets</h3>

<p>Di repository GitHub yang sudah di-fork:</p>
<p><strong>Settings &gt; Secrets and variables &gt; Actions &gt; New repository secret</strong></p>

<p>Tambahkan 4 secrets berikut:</p>

<table>
<tr><th>Secret Name</th><th>Value</th><th>Cara Mendapatkan</th></tr>
<tr><td>EC2_HOST</td><td>IP publik EC2</td><td>Output dari Step 6 (<code>instance_public_ip</code>)</td></tr>
<tr><td>EC2_SSH_KEY</td><td>Isi private key lengkap</td><td>Jalankan: <code>type %USERPROFILE%\.ssh\vm-demo-key</code><br>Copy SEMUA termasuk BEGIN/END</td></tr>
<tr><td>DOCKERHUB_USERNAME</td><td>Username Docker Hub</td><td>Dari akun Docker Hub kamu</td></tr>
<tr><td>DOCKERHUB_TOKEN</td><td>Access Token Docker Hub</td><td>Buat di: hub.docker.com &gt; Account Settings &gt; Security &gt; New Access Token</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>STEP 9: Update Docker Hub Username di Manifest</h3>

<p>Edit file <code>k8s/deployment.yaml</code>, cari baris image dan ganti:</p>

<pre>image: USERNAME_DOCKERHUB_ANDA/devops-demo-app:latest</pre>

<h3>STEP 10: Push dan Trigger CI/CD Pipeline</h3>

<pre>git add .
git commit -m "setup: configure for deployment"
git push</pre>

<div class="success"><strong>Hasil:</strong> GitHub Actions akan otomatis:
<ol>
<li>Build Docker image dari <code>app/Dockerfile</code></li>
<li>Push image ke Docker Hub dengan tag SHA commit (bukan latest)</li>
<li>SSH ke EC2</li>
<li>Update image tag di deployment manifest</li>
<li>Apply Kubernetes manifests ke K3d cluster</li>
</ol>
</div>

<p>Cek status di: <code>https://github.com/USERNAME/project-web-devops/actions</code></p>

<h3>STEP 11: Verifikasi Deployment</h3>

<p>Buka browser:</p>

<pre>http://&lt;IP_EC2&gt;:30080</pre>

<p>Atau dari dalam VM via SSH:</p>

<pre>kubectl get pods
kubectl get svc</pre>

<p>Expected:</p>
<pre>NAME                               READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE
devops-demo-app-xxxxx-xxxxx        1/1     Running   0          1m
devops-demo-app-xxxxx-xxxxx        1/1     Running   0          1m
devops-demo-app-xxxxx-xxxxx        1/1     Running   0          1m</pre>

<h2>5. Struktur Project</h2>

<pre>project-web-devops/
+-- .github/workflows/
|   +-- deploy.yml              # CI/CD pipeline (GitHub Actions)
+-- app/
|   +-- index.html              # Frontend (Meal Planner App)
|   +-- style.css               # Styling (retro clean white theme)
|   +-- app.js                  # Application logic + calorie reference
|   +-- nginx.conf              # Nginx configuration
|   +-- Dockerfile              # Container build (Nginx Alpine)
|   +-- .dockerignore
+-- k8s/
|   +-- deployment.yaml         # Kubernetes Deployment (3 replicas)
|   +-- service.yaml            # NodePort Service (port 30080)
+-- terraform/
|   +-- main.tf                 # VPC + SG + EC2 (generated via DevFormat)
|   +-- variables.tf            # Input variables
|   +-- outputs.tf              # Output values
|   +-- terraform.tfvars        # Values - GITIGNORED
+-- scripts/
|   +-- setup-vm.sh             # Script install Docker + K3d
+-- docs/
|   +-- lab-guide.html          # Lab guide (dokumen ini)
+-- .gitignore
+-- README.md</pre>

<h2>6. Cleanup - Hapus Semua Resource</h2>

<div class="warning"><strong>PENTING:</strong> Selalu hapus resource AWS setelah selesai lab untuk menghindari biaya.</div>

<p>Dari komputer lokal (CMD):</p>

<pre>cd terraform
terraform destroy -auto-approve</pre>

<p>Verifikasi di AWS Console bahwa semua resource (EC2, VPC, SG) sudah terhapus.</p>

<h2>7. Troubleshooting</h2>

<table>
<tr><th>Error</th><th>Penyebab</th><th>Solusi</th></tr>
<tr><td>No valid credential sources found</td><td>AWS CLI belum dikonfigurasi</td><td>Jalankan <code>aws configure</code>, isi Access Key + Secret Key</td></tr>
<tr><td>InvalidKey.Format</td><td>SSH key format salah</td><td>Generate ulang dengan <code>ssh-keygen -t ed25519</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Permission denied (publickey)</td><td>Path SSH key salah atau key tidak match</td><td>Gunakan format path Windows di CMD: <code>%USERPROFILE%\.ssh\vm-demo-key</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>kubectl connection refused (port 8080)</td><td>KUBECONFIG belum di-set</td><td>Jalankan: <code>export KUBECONFIG=/home/ubuntu/.kube/config</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>scp: No such file</td><td>Folder target belum ada di VM</td><td>SSH ke VM dan <code>mkdir -p /home/ubuntu/k8s</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>K3d cluster lambat/hang</td><td>RAM tidak cukup</td><td>Gunakan minimal t3.medium (4GB RAM)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Terraform provider download lama</td><td>AWS provider berukuran ~350MB</td><td>Tunggu 2-5 menit tergantung internet</td></tr>
<tr><td>error loading kubeconfig: permission denied</td><td>kubeconfig milik root</td><td><code>sudo k3d kubeconfig get mycluster &gt; ~/.kube/config</code></td></tr>
</table>

<h2>8. Tools Pendukung - DevFormat</h2>

<p>Website: <strong>https://devformat.com</strong></p>

<p>Tools yang digunakan untuk generate konfigurasi dalam lab ini:</p>

<table>
<tr><th>Tool</th><th>Kegunaan dalam Lab</th><th>Output</th></tr>
<tr><td>Terraform Generator</td><td>Generate infrastructure code untuk AWS VPC + EC2</td><td>main.tf, variables.tf, outputs.tf, terraform.tfvars</td></tr>
<tr><td>Dockerfile Generator</td><td>Generate Dockerfile optimized untuk Nginx</td><td>Dockerfile (multi-stage, non-root user)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Kubernetes Generator</td><td>Generate Deployment dan Service manifest</td><td>deployment.yaml, service.yaml</td></tr>
</table>

<p style="text-align:center; margin-top:30pt; color:#7f8c8d; font-size:9pt;">--- End of Lab Guide ---</p>

